  "name": "E38 · concept memory · 141.5M (120.8M core)",
  "description": "E38 arm e37a — concept memory, 150M leaderboard size (m120t); Hub id Meridian21Lab/concept-memory-140m-11.5bt. New against e37a_m100: e37a at the 150M leaderboard size (m120t): 13 layers (2 more stacked), FFN 2,816, the SmolLM2 vocabulary (49,152), the output tied to the input table through one 896 → 384 projection. Protocol (E38 leaderboard recipe): 11.5B tokens of m21mix_v2 (SmolLM2 tokens): 8.0B in rows of 4,096, then 3.0B at 16,384, then 0.5B at 65,536; 128 rows of 4k per step (32 of 16k, 8 of 64k); Muon from one peak (0.01; the 64k phase at a tenth) with AdamW; one 4 × L40S AWS node per model. Trunk (as the trainer builds m120t): L0–L2 local (window 128), L3 the reading layer, L4 local; [L3, L4] run 4 times with shared weights and a per-round embedding; then L5–L12 local; RoPE θ 500k except on L7 and L11 (every 4th stacked layer); U-net skips L5→L7, L4→L8, L3→L9, L2→L10, L1→L11, L0→L12 (one scalar each, zero at the start); 14 query heads × 64, 1 key/value head, QK norm; SwiGLU 2,816; logits = (h·Pᵀ)·Eᵀ with P [384 × 896] the head's only weights (0.34M instead of an untied head's 44M), softcap 30, z-loss 1e-4. Built 2026-11-21; status released (as of 2026-11-21). Public on the Hugging Face Hub since 2026-11-18. Concept settings: 64 concepts of 8 keys per 512-key block, 4 sinks, 512 opened tokens, one summary per other concept; 3 grouping iterations, temperature 0.05, key variance on; the summaries' length scale at 16,384 (concept_sum_len: past it their total weight is held at that length's level, so it acts in the 64k phase). Spec: docs/experiments_specs/ahead/E38_long_budget_mix.md. Source: origin/dev @ 99d808a7. Not a builder field: Grouping, statistics and the choice have no weights (0-parameter custom cells); the summaries are the concepts' mean key and value (a notes cell with no projections); the block window and opened tokens are drawn as a 1,280-key window. The summaries' length scale has no weights and no builder field. The run setup shows 4 × H100 (the builder has no L40S preset) and one optimizer, Muon (the trainer pairs Muon with AdamW). The phase lengths 16k and 64k are not part of the run setup (it shows the 4k phase). Parameters: 141,506,208 in total, 120,795,936 without the word tables (input embedding 20,366,208 + output layer 344,064); exact against the trainer's own count (scripts/run_e33n.py count() on fit(\"e37a\", \"m120t\") — FFN 2816 as set, the trainer's factory on the meta device with the SmolLM2 vocabulary of 49,152: the total with non_embedding=False, the core is count()'s default; the tied table is counted once, in the input embedding).",
